    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "SIM-083",
    "deck": "simile",
    "text": "The old man's back was bent like a coat hanger left too long under a heavy coat.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "grief",
      "target": "body",
      "intensity": 2
    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "SIM-084",
    "deck": "simile",
    "text": "He came at me slow and sure as a streetcar that isn't going to stop for you.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "menace",
      "target": "body",
      "intensity": 2
    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "SIM-085",
    "deck": "simile",
    "text": "He dropped into the chair like a sack of mail off the tail end of a route.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "tired",
      "target": "body",
      "intensity": 1
    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "SIM-086",
    "deck": "simile",
    "text": "His suit fit him the way a good alibi fits — almost, and not quite around the shoulders.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "wry",
      "target": "clothes",
      "intensity": 2
    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "SIM-087",
    "deck": "simile",
    "text": "Her coat was good wool once, worn now thin as a rumor.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "grief",
      "target": "clothes",
      "intensity": 2
    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "SIM-088",
    "deck": "simile",
    "text": "He kept his hat on indoors, the way a man does who means to leave fast.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "menace",
      "target": "clothes",
      "intensity": 2
    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "SIM-089",
    "deck": "simile",
    "text": "Her gloves were white as a coroner's report and just as clean.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "flat",
      "target": "clothes",
      "intensity": 2
    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "SIM-090",
    "deck": "simile",
    "text": "His collar was boiled stiff as his manner.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "wry",
      "target": "clothes",
      "intensity": 1
    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "SIM-091",
    "deck": "simile",
    "text": "The topcoat hung on him loose as a story that didn't fit the facts.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "menace",
      "target": "clothes",
      "intensity": 2
    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "SIM-092",
    "deck": "simile",
    "text": "Her hat sat at an angle sharp as her opinion of him.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "wry",
      "target": "clothes",
      "intensity": 1
    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "SIM-093",
    "deck": "simile",
    "text": "His spats were spotless, the way a man's hands never are when he's telling the truth.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "menace",
      "target": "clothes",
      "intensity": 3
    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "SIM-094",
    "deck": "simile",
    "text": "The city at that hour ran quiet as a shuttered Automat.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "tired",
      "target": "city",
      "intensity": 1
    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "SIM-095",
    "deck": "simile",
    "text": "New York didn't stop for a dead man any more than a subway stops for a dropped nickel.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "flat",
      "target": "city",
      "intensity": 2
    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "SIM-096",
    "deck": "simile",
    "text": "The town closed ranks around him the way a precinct closes ranks around a bad arrest.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "menace",
      "target": "city",
      "intensity": 2
    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "SIM-097",
    "deck": "simile",
    "text": "Downtown at midnight was empty as a collection plate at the second service.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "tired",
      "target": "city",
      "intensity": 1
    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "SIM-098",
    "deck": "simile",
    "text": "The city kept its own hours, the way a speakeasy keeps its own clock.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "wry",
      "target": "city",
      "intensity": 2
    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "SIM-099",
    "deck": "simile",
    "text": "The whole block knew before the coroner did, the way a tenement always knows first.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "menace",
      "target": "city",
      "intensity": 2
    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "SIM-100",
    "deck": "simile",
    "text": "The town forgot him fast as a headline forgets yesterday's fire.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "grief",
      "target": "city",
      "intensity": 2
    },
    "status": "generated"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-p001",
    "deck": "similes",
    "text": "Hands that had been in cold water all evening and had given up complaining about it, the fingers going at the buttons like a man picking a lock he owns.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "tired",
      "target": "hands",
      "intensity": 3
    },
    "status": "placeholder",
    "notes": "Placeholder. Reserved id range sim-pNNN; the content deck uses SIM-NNN. Fills the six intensity-3 targets the M3 deck had none of."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-p002",
    "deck": "similes",
    "text": "The street ran two blocks with nothing on it but a parked truck and the kind of quiet that has somebody in it, and then it turned and was an ordinary street again.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "menace",
      "target": "street",
      "intensity": 3
    },
    "status": "placeholder"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-p003",
    "deck": "similes",
    "text": "Cold came off the river the way it comes off a tiled wall, and stayed on the near side of the coat.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "flat",
      "target": "weather",
      "intensity": 3
    },
    "status": "placeholder"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-p004",
    "deck": "similes",
    "text": "The silence in the room had a shape, and the shape was a chair pushed back from a table with the meal still on it.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "grief",
      "target": "silence",
      "intensity": 3
    },
    "status": "placeholder"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-p005",
    "deck": "similes",
    "text": "Under the sheet the shape was shorter than the man had been, the way a coat is shorter off the hook than on it.",
    "tags": {
      "mood": "flat",
      "target": "body",
      "intensity": 3
    },
    "status": "placeholder"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-p006",
    "deck": "similes",
    "text": "The city at that hour ran on the night shift and the night shift ran on coffee and habit, and neither of them asked me anything.",
